# adlaplace

Laplace approximations for hierarchical models using CppAD (via the
**RCppAD** R package) and trust-region optimization.

## Install

From [R-universe](https://eborgnine.r-universe.dev) (binaries when available):

```r
install.packages(
  c("RCppAD", "adlaplace"),
  repos = c("https://eborgnine.r-universe.dev", "https://cloud.r-project.org")
)
```

